[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25382.708, "timestamp": "07:03:02", "text": "模型相关的一切都包括这些。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25385.91, "timestamp": "07:03:05", "text": "索具工已经准备好索具了，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25387.51, "timestamp": "07:03:07", "text": "我现在没钱。所以，他们处于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25390.07, "timestamp": "07:03:10", "text": "钢笔。它们目前处于待处理状态。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25391.83, "timestamp": "07:03:11", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25395.35, "timestamp": "07:03:15", "text": "我本应该在发布会上或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25397.51, "timestamp": "07:03:17", "text": "比如展示新车型的轮廓，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25399.75, "timestamp": "07:03:19", "text": "但我因为一些原因做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25402.39, "timestamp": "07:03:22", "text": "幕后种种复杂情况，比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25404.468, "timestamp": "07:03:24", "text": "这件艺术品必须有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25406.23, "timestamp": "07:03:26", "text": "一切都变了，都是因为某些原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25409.35, "timestamp": "07:03:29", "text": "需要进行修正，因为它无法操纵。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25411.67, "timestamp": "07:03:31", "text": "这门艺术是不可更改的。所以，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25414.548, "timestamp": "07:03:34", "text": "问题很多，但都已解决。现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25417.27, "timestamp": "07:03:37", "text": "我想，这多少还是可以调整的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25419.35, "timestamp": "07:03:39", "text": "修复了很多问题，姿势也调整好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25426.708, "timestamp": "07:03:46", "text": "所以我希望我能以某种方式支付。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25428.948, "timestamp": "07:03:48", "text": "分期付款之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25431.27, "timestamp": "07:03:51", "text": "有了驾照，我就可以戏弄这台发动机了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25435.11, "timestamp": "07:03:55", "text": "然后就像，嗯，付一点，一半。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25437.51, "timestamp": "07:03:57", "text": "一半左右"}]